# Database — Advanced

Enable when rule level includes `advanced`. Schema still **follows concept**.

- Indexes for real query paths from the concept (not speculative)
- DB-level constraints (FK, unique, check) aligned with domain invariants
- Multi-tenant / ownership columns when the concept requires isolation
- Audit / history tables for money, permissions, or irreversible actions when domain needs them
- Migration expand/contract for zero-downtime when deploy model requires it
- Seed strategies: deterministic IDs for demos; never seed production secrets
- Avoid N+1 in list endpoints; paginate large concept collections
